==French==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|fro|fr}} {{term|avuec}}, ''[[avoc#Old French|avoc]]'' from {{VL.|fr}} {{term|abhoc|aboc, abhoc}}, a {{etyl|frk|-}} corruption of {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|apud hoc||with this, near this, close to this}}.  Used as a replacement of {{la}} ''[[cum]]'' "with" in [[w:Merovingian|Merovingian]] and [[w:Carolingian|Carolingian]] documents. Gradually supplanted Old French {{term|od||with}}.

